  "why": "F493: an operator respawn 100 ms after a death. The revive burst waits in the play queue behind the native death scream and lands about 1.3 s later; the weapon delay runs from the burst, so `$BMAP,0,0` follows the burst's `$BMAP,0,98` and the player can fire.",
